<p>I dunno. I mean, I like the story that's told, full stop. But the intelligence tests are just letters and numbers with no meaning; it took me well past the halfway point to realize I could even glean information from them. And &quot;guy reincarnates as kid&quot; just seems so&#8230; pedestrian? I mean, yeah, that's an anomaly, it's anomalous, but I nevertheless found myself wondering why the Foundation would even care. Looking at it from the outside, this is a kid under the delusion that he's a sixty-year-old man. And he slowly loses that delusion. It just seems hard to call this an anomaly worth containment. Novote.</p>

